<x-layouts.public title="Privacy Policy">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500">Effective date: 6 November 2026</p>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">About Followly</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">Followly (https://followly.link) is a service that helps users organize and view updates from public creators and other accounts across supported third-party platforms. The operator is Salah M Al, based in Kuwait. Contact: <a href="mailto:efollowly@yahoo.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">efollowly@yahoo.com</a>.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Information We Collect</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">When you use Followly, we collect your name and email address, your password in hashed form only, any profile photo or banner you upload, the accounts you follow, your preferences and notification settings, service usage and diagnostic information, IP addresses and device/browser details.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Information About Creators</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">Followly shows public profile details and posts of creators, including creators who do not have a Followly account. This information is collected from the platforms where it was published, through official APIs and third-party data-collection services. Creators can ask us to correct or remove it by following our <a href="{{ route('data-deletion') }}" wire:navigate class="text-accent hover:underline">data deletion instructions</a>.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">How And Why We Use Information</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">We use data to operate accounts, personalize feeds, send the notifications and digests you choose, maintain security, troubleshoot, respond to requests and meet legal obligations.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Cookies</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">We use cookies that keep you signed in and protect the service. Where enabled, Google Analytics also uses cookies to measure how the site is used. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, but blocking essential cookies may prevent you from signing in.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Third-Party Services And Disclosures</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">We use hosting, email delivery, analytics and data-collection providers, including Google Analytics, Apify and the YouTube API Services. These providers may process data on our behalf. We may disclose information when required by law. Third-party content remains subject to its provider's terms and privacy practices.</p>
                <p class="mt-2">Our use of YouTube API Services is subject to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:underline">YouTube Terms of Service</a> and the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:underline">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Retention And Deletion</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">We retain account information while needed for service operation and applicable obligations. You can delete your account at any time from Settings, which removes it from our live systems immediately. After a verified deletion request, we aim to delete eligible personal data within 30 days, subject to lawful exceptions and technical backup cycles.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Your Choices</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">You may request access, correction or deletion, and change your followed accounts and notification settings. Contact <a href="mailto:efollowly@yahoo.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">efollowly@yahoo.com</a>. Identity verification may be needed to protect your information.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Security And International Processing</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">We use proportionate technical and organizational safeguards. Data may be processed by providers outside Kuwait. No service can guarantee absolute security.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Children</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">Followly is not intended for children under 18.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Changes And Contact</h2>
                <p class="mt-2">We may update this policy and publish a new effective date. Website: https://followly.link. Operator: Salah M Al. Email: <a href="mailto:efollowly@yahoo.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">efollowly@yahoo.com</a>.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </article>
</x-layouts.public>
